+    """
+    Generate chunks of atomic and grid indices based on the maximum grid chunk size.
+    Input:
+        atomic_grid_sizes: A tensor of atomic grid sizes.
+        max_grid_chunk_size: The maximum size of each grid chunk.
+    Returns:
